    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Dashboard: Strategic Recommendations'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='639' maxwidth='984' minheight='639' minwidth='984' preset-index='17' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='97496' id='8' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98374' x='813' y='1252'>
            <zone h='97496' id='5' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98374' x='813' y='1252'>
              <zone fixed-size='752' h='97496' id='6' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98374' x='813' y='1252'>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='97496' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98374' x='813' y='1252'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#266799' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='16'>Strategic Recommendations</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f7a7f' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Optimize Discount Strategy</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Reduce excessive discounting above 20–25% where profitability consistently declines. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Focus promotions on high-margin products rather than broad discount campaigns. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f7a7f' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Prioritize High-Performing Categories</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Continue investing in Technology and strong Office Supplies sub-categories that consistently generate both high revenue and strong profit margins. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Reevaluate low-margin Furniture products such as Tables and Bookcases. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f7a7f' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Improve Sales Performance Consistency</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Use top-performing sales representatives as benchmarks for training and sales strategy development. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Provide additional support and coaching to underperforming sales teams. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f7a7f' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Expand High-Growth Regional Opportunities</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Increase marketing and operational focus in high-performing regions such as the West and East. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Investigate growth opportunities in lower-performing regions to improve market penetration. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f7a7f' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Strengthen Customer Retention Strategy</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Identify high-value customers and develop loyalty or targeted retention programs. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Focus on long-term customer profitability rather than short-term sales volume alone.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='8' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='12' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='background-color' value='#e6e6e6' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
